<title>UK: SBC sets call and put warrants on sterling/mark.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call and put warrants on sterling/mark.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 40 million American-style call and put warrants, in four equal tranches, on the sterling/mark exchange rate, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	ISS PRICE	PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	  2.45 DEM     8.14 DEM	0.80 PCT     30.90 X</p>
<p> PUT B	   2.45 DEM     7.44 DEM	5.40 PCT     33.80 X</p>
<p> CALL C	  2.50 DEM     5.49 DEM	1.70 PCT     45.70 X</p>
<p> PUT D	   2.50 DEM    10.35 DEM	4.60 PCT     24.30 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 13.NOV.96-15.SEP.97   PAYDATE	12.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT DDF		   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  2.5114 DEM</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
